---
import SelfieImg from "../../assets/images/index/about_photo.png"
import RouxImg from "../../assets/images/index/about_roux.png"
import QuoteSvg from "../../assets/svg/quote.svg"
import HandballSvg from "../../assets/svg/handball.svg"

import { Image } from "astro:assets"
---

<section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Me, Myself, and I</h2>

        <div class="grid">
            <div class="photo">
                <Image src={SelfieImg} alt="Selfie of me smiling with my camera" />
                <h3>PHOTO</h3>
                <p>
                    I enjoy photography with my <br>
                    SONY A3000 camera
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="cubing">
                <Image src={RouxImg} alt="A detection of the ROUX method for the Rubik's cube" />
                <h3>SPEEDCUBER</h3>
                <p>
                    Sub 40 seconds <br>
                    with the ROUX method
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="philosophy">
                <div class="header">
                    <QuoteSvg />
                    <h3>PHILOSOPHY</h3>
                </div>
                <p>
                    Philosophy is truly fascinating. Because there are so many things to think about. That have already been thought of. That reading a new book brings new perspective, even when you know the contents. Therefore thinking about thinking, is the greatest tool of all.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="handball">
                <HandballSvg />
                <h3>HANDBALL</h3>
                <p>
                    Played since 10 years old. <br>
                    Participated at senior Norwegian Championship at age 16. <br>
                    Currently a goalie at GSI.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    section {
        background-color: var(--color-bg-alt);
        padding-top: 78px;
        padding-bottom: 95px;

        h2 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            letter-spacing: -2%;
            line-height: 90%;
            margin-bottom: 54px;
        }
    }

    .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
        grid-template-rows: repeat(2, minmax(326px, auto));
        gap: 2rem;

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            grid-template-rows: auto auto auto auto;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        > * {
            border-radius: 4px;
            position: relative;

            h3 {
                font-size: 2rem;
                font-family: inherit;
                font-style: italic;
                letter-spacing: -2%;
                margin-top: 40px;
                line-height: 100%;

                @media (max-width: 900px) {
                    font-size: 1.5rem;
                }
            }

            p {
                font-size: 1.25rem;
                line-height: 150%;
                margin: 0;

                @media (max-width: 900px) {
                    font-size: 1rem;
                }
            }
        }

        .photo {
            grid-column: span 4;
            background-color: var(--color-accent);
            color: var(--color-accent-bg);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-end;

            text-align: right;
            padding-right: 40px;

            @media (max-width: 900px) {
                grid-column: span 1;
                min-height: 139px;
            }

            img {
                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;
                height: 100%;
                width: auto;
                opacity: 0.75;
                pointer-events: none;
                z-index: 0;
            }

            img ~ * {
                background-color: var(--color-accent);
                z-index: 1;
                width: fit-content;
            }
        }

        .cubing {
            grid-column: span 2;
            background-color: var(--color-green);
            color: var(--color-green-bg);

            padding-left: 40px;

            @media (max-width: 900px) {
                grid-column: span 1;
                min-height: 204px;
            }

            img {
                position: absolute;
                right: 13px;
                bottom: 26px;
                width: 189px;
                height: auto;
                opacity: 0.2;
                pointer-events: none;
            }
        }

        .philosophy {
            grid-column: span 3;
            background-color: var(--color-green-bg);
            color: var(--color-body);

            padding-inline: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 40px;

            @media (max-width: 900px) {
                grid-column: span 1;

                svg {
                    width: 59px;
                }
            }

            .header {
                margin-top: 40px;
                padding-left: 40px;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: flex-start;

                h3 {
                    margin-top: 0;
                    color: var(--color-green);
                }
            }
        }

        .handball {
            grid-column: span 3;
            background-color: var(--color-accent-bg);
            color: var(--color-accent);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;

            @media (max-width: 900px) {
                grid-column: span 1;
                min-height: 201px;
                padding: 20px;
            }

            h3 {
                margin-top: 67px;
                z-index: 2;

                @media (max-width: 900px) {
                    margin-top: 0;
                }
            }

            p {
                padding-top: 1.5rem;
                text-align: center;
                z-index: 2;
            }

            svg {
                position: absolute;
                z-index: 1;
                right: 30px;
                top: 10px;
                bottom: 10px;
                height: 90%;
                width: auto;
            }
        }
    }

    img {
        max-width: 100%;
        height: auto;
    }
</style>